| Example: `this.name`           | Example: `this("Deepak", 22)` |


### Example

```java
class Student {

    String name;
    int age;

    Student() {
        this("Deepak", 22);
    }

    Student(String name, int age) {
        this.name = name;
        this.age = age;
    }
}
```

Here:

- `this("Deepak", 22)` calls another constructor.
- `this.name` refers to the current object's instance variable.
- `this.age` refers to the current object's instance variable.

